title: "When Weak Intent Becomes a Requirement: replication package"
type: software
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NicolasSchuler/re-uq"
url: "https://github.com/NicolasSchuler/re-uq"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a study of whether large language models preserve
  the modal force of requirements when extracting them, whether lightweight
  uncertainty signals expose strengthening of weak stakeholder intent, and
  whether output-based checks detect it. Contains the frozen prompts, the
  benchmark, the campaign configuration, the analysis code, the paper tables
  with provenance, and the figures; raw model outputs are archived in a
  separate Zenodo dataset record.
